<title>AI Internal Linking, Scoring Formulas</title>
<style>
body { font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.5; }
h1 { font-size: 22pt; color: #1a3d6d; margin-bottom: 2pt; }
h2 { font-size: 15pt; color: #1a3d6d; margin-top: 22pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #c8d4e3; padding-bottom: 3pt; }
